WEBVTT

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:09.290
In the world of Duel Monsters, we were entrusted with the power of a legendary dragon.

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:12.890
It's hard to believe, but it wasn't a dream.

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:15.800
A huge monster suddenly appeared in the night sky.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.430
It's trying to destroy the world?

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:22.600
The legendary dragon Timaeus repelled it.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.090
But the battle has only begun.

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:48.070
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:55.210
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:55.990 --> 00:01:01.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:07.860
I was searching for your smile

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:15.230
With our memories fading

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:22.310
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:29.210
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:36.440
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:56.390 --> 00:02:02.030
Pegasus's Invitation

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:17.880
After the arrival of Duel Monsters, auroras and giant tornadoes appeared worldwide yesterday.

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:22.480
We also had auroras and tornadoes last night.

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:25.020
Some say they saw monsters too.

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:28.860
So last night wasn't a dream.

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:35.860
Especially since we have a card from the world of Duel Monsters.

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:40.540
It looks like a regular card.

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:43.310
Hard to believe it has strange powers.

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:44.960
Handle it with care!

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:49.220
Only a true duelist is given such a valuable card.

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:51.150
Right, Yugi?

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:54.880
Yeah.  It's very valuable.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:03.460
The power to save the world - Eye of Timaeus.

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.580
What'll you do now?

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:09.820
Do?  We don't have a lead on the bad guys.

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:16.700
We don't know where Doma's Three Musketeers went after stealing Yugi's God Cards.

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:19.910
There's so many things we don't know!

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:22.850
My other self.

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:29.720
Can anything provide a lead?

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:35.130
Maybe this thing will glow again and show us where our enemies are.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.050
You said handle it with care!

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:40.900
Quiet, you!  I'm just testing it out!

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:44.460
- What are you doing?
- Knock it off!

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:46.840
Sounds like you're having fun!

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:49.010
Grandpa!  What's up?

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:52.450
You received a package.  From America.

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:54.460
America?

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:58.380
It could be from Otogi.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:01.570
Oh yeah.  He's in America.

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:03.610
What is it, Yugi?

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:07.860
Hmm...  Industrial Illusions...

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:10.660
What?

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:17.450
Industrial Illusions is Pegasus's company, right?

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:19.500
Yeah.  He sent a card.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.120
And a videotape.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:25.500
This is the same as Duelist Kingdom!

00:04:30.510 --> 00:04:34.020
Grandpa!  Jonouchi!  Honda!  Anzu!

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.340
Now no one will bother us.

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:39.620
Shall we begin, Yugi boy?

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:41.630
This is a Shadow Game!

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:45.400
I possess the Millennium Eye's shadow power.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:47.070
Millennium Eye?

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:52.700
Let's meet again at the Kingdom if you want to reclaim what's most dear to you.

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:05.420
Yugi!

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:10.180
Shouldn't we just trash it?

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:15.230
Pegasus doesn't have the Millennium Eye anymore, so maybe it's fine.

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:18.970
Oh yeah.  Someone stole it from him.

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:20.750
But still...

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.660
My other self.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:27.370
The Millennium Eye chose Pegasus, even if he doesn't own it anymore.

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:31.310
And he created Duel Monsters.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:35.250
So he may be involved in what's happening?

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:37.680
Yes.  Very likely.

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:41.980
Let's watch it.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.490
But Yugi!

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.990
Remember I warned you!

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:52.600
Long time no see, Yugi boy.

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:54.260
It's him!

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:55.700
Pegasus.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:06:00.370
You must know about the strange events happening worldwide.

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:03.750
Phew.  It looks like a normal video.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:04.540
Yeah.

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:08.120
I created the game Duel Monsters.

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:13.570
Those monsters have become real, causing a panic worldwide.

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:21.490
I've been investigating why, and I learned something.

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:23.930
Learned what?

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:30.100
Yugi boy, I must talk to you in person.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:38.710
But I can't come to you because someone is watching me.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:39.880
What?

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:43.100
I don't know if this letter will reach you.

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:47.250
But if it does, take the enclosed card.

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:49.690
And come to America!

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:51.350
America?

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:54.360
I sent a plane to pick you up.

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:57.340
Hurry!  I'll be waiting!

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:01.290
What's going on?

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:02.240
Yugi...

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:06.560
We must go.  We have no other leads.

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:08.170
You're right.

00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:11.150
I'm going to America!

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:13.370
Yugi...

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:16.390
Yeah, there's no point sitting around!

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:17.580
I'm going too!

00:07:18.090 --> 00:07:19.350
Jonouchi!

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:22.190
I won't let you go alone!

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:24.280
You're right.  I'm going too!

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:27.290
Then let's prepare for our trip!

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:28.450
Everyone...

00:07:29.730 --> 00:07:34.220
Since Pegasus is sending a plane, we can fly to America for free!

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.290
That's right!

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:36.870
Sheesh...

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:39.440
- Let's go!
- Yeah!

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:41.660
America?

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:47.020
Pegasus, the creator of Duel Monsters, invited Yugi?

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:52.580
Wait...  Industrial Illusions is the company that sells all the cards.

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:54.750
So they must have many rare cards!

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:56.760
Rare cards?

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:02.560
Have as many rare cards as you want!

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:06.500
Wow!

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.690
Thank you, Pegasus!

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:11.250
Rare cards...

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:13.670
It's unfair!

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:15.940
They can't have all the rare cards!

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:20.080
Yeah!  They can't have all the luck!

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:23.380
Yeah!  Let's get rare cards too!

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:25.390
But how?

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.870
I have an idea.

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:07.920
By using the souls of captured duelists and the three God Cards, the door has opened.

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:09.360
However...

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:12.470
Lend me your strength, Timaeus!

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:18.750
I didn't expect the Nameless Pharaoh to get that dragon's power.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:26.280
Our god was just born.

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:30.330
I need more sacrifices to give it strength.

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:34.520
Nameless Pharaoh, I won't let you interfere.

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:35.860
Rafael!

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:45.890
I promise to sacrifice the Nameless Pharaoh's soul to our god.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.830
That won't be enough!

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:55.000
To completely resurrect our god, we need many powerful duelists' souls.

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:58.840
Leave Seto Kaiba's soul to me.

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:01.300
I'll get Katsuya Jonouchi's.

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:06.210
I'll pummel him and steal his soul.

00:10:06.860 --> 00:10:08.650
Doing it for the girl?

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:12.090
None of your business!  What about you?

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:14.530
Why are you obsessed with Kaiba?

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:16.890
None of your business.

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:17.710
What?

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:20.250
Cut it out!  We're in the presence of Dartz.

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:28.700
The Nameless Pharaoh is on his way to Pegasus J. Crawford, another duelist with a strong soul.

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:30.140
Pegasus?

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:33.140
I already made plans for him.

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:35.080
Head over there.

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:52.800
Yugi boy, come quickly!

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:56.400
Before it's too late!

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:07.540
You are...

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:10.060
No!

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:29.250
Umm...

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:32.290
How long will the trip be?

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:40.460
America...

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:46.830
Didn't expect to go back there again.

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:56.170
What am I supposed to pack for America?

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:02.680
I'll be away for a while, but don't worry.

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:05.830
Don't catch a cold, Shizuka.

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:18.910
I better not forget this.

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:22.690
Key of Illusion.

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:26.120
What's this key card for this time?

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:28.290
What do you think, my other self?

00:12:31.030 --> 00:12:32.400
My other self?

00:12:33.400 --> 00:12:34.560
What is it, partner?

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:37.000
What's on your mind?

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.640
Nothing.

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:43.210
You're lying.  You're keeping something to yourself.

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:44.760
Partner...

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:48.140
I can't hide anything from you.

00:12:48.650 --> 00:12:50.080
My other self...

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:53.100
I was thinking about our new enemies.

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:55.520
Who are they?

00:12:55.520 --> 00:13:02.190
If I hadn't lost my memories, I may have known who they are.

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:03.600
You're doing it again.

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:08.430
Don't hide how you're feeling.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:11.230
There are too many things I don't know.

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:12.760
Partner...

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:16.670
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:19.680
Something unfamiliar is coming.

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:21.340
I'm really worried!

00:13:21.340 --> 00:13:22.620
Partner...

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:26.140
Sorry about that.

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.280
Gotta get to sleep!

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:30.940
Good night, my other self.

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:48.380
Bye, Grandpa!

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:53.240
I'll call you if I get any info from Arthur.

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:55.100
Okay.  I'm off!

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.260
Bye.

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:57.680
- See ya.
- Later.

00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:59.320
Be careful.

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:11.430
Wow!  We're flying on that?

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:15.500
Rich people are big time!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.370
Both Pegasus and Kaiba.

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:21.450
That reminds me.  Kaiba is currently in America, Yugi.

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:26.990
Yeah.  But he's having trouble because Duel Monsters have appeared worldwide.

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:28.540
Serves him right!

00:14:29.770 --> 00:14:31.480
Are you Yugi Muto?

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:33.160
Yes.

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:36.420
Welcome.  Please follow me.

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:37.520
Sure.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:41.000
We'll take care of your luggage, so leave it there.

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:51.610
Wow!  It's like a reception room!

00:14:51.610 --> 00:14:54.000
And it's just for us?

00:14:55.940 --> 00:14:58.130
This seat is comfy!

00:14:58.130 --> 00:14:59.570
Yugi!  Come sit!

00:15:01.110 --> 00:15:02.010
Okay.

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:06.840
Hey!  Come help me!

00:15:18.240 --> 00:15:19.570
Hey, what's up?

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:20.740
It's nothing.

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:35.910
All right!  We're off to America!

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:45.400
Good.  My plan worked.

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:48.600
We're going to America too!

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:51.560
But we have to stay here 'til we get there?

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:55.260
We have no choice.  We won't get any rare cards if they find us.

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:01.130
Looks delicious!

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:05.000
S-So cold...

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:08.010
But must stay strong for the rare cards...

00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:16.920
We're going to die!

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:19.950
Who came up with this stupid idea?

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:23.190
Stay strong...  Rare cards...

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:43.660
We're here!

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:45.630
It was a smooth flight.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.610
Please get in this car.

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:51.590
A limo!

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:55.060
Huh?  I don't remember this bag.

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:57.050
Who's bag is this?

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:58.380
Not mine.

00:16:58.380 --> 00:16:59.570
Me neither.

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:03.030
Maybe we brought someone else's by mistake.

00:17:03.030 --> 00:17:04.200
Is that so?

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:06.310
I'll return it.

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:08.960
America...

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:10.070
Rare cards...

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:22.880
I already talked about that!

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:28.100
Kaiba Corporation's Solid Vision has nothing to do with these incidents!

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:29.920
Tell the press!

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:36.830
What's going on?

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:42.500
Is someone trying to set Kaiba Corporation up for a scandal?

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:48.000
Has Industrial Illusions responded yet?

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.370
Not yet.

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:51.370
Get in touch with them!

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:58.200
Just when I'm about to launch my World Kaiba Land Project...

00:17:58.560 --> 00:17:59.660
Big brother!

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:03.990
Big trouble!  Someone is buying lots of Kaiba Corporation stock!

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:05.450
What?

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:15.010
Impossible!

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:21.180
How could someone buy so many shares without my notice?

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:24.120
What should we do?

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.280
He won't get away with this!

00:18:26.280 --> 00:18:32.720
If you get in my way, I'll hunt you down and make you pay!

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:39.060
What?

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:41.500
Hi, Kaiba boy!

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:43.440
Pegasus!

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:47.370
Did you receive my message?

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:51.300
It was you!

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:53.880
Just my way of saying hello.

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:56.480
Seems you didn't like that.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:19:02.410
You're still trying to take over Kaiba Corporation?

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:06.300
Don't be so angry.

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:09.400
It was just a demonstration.

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:11.090
Demonstration?

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:15.010
Yes.  Before our big duel.

00:19:15.010 --> 00:19:18.410
I want to duel you.

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:19.760
Will you accept?

00:19:19.980 --> 00:19:22.100
I don't have to listen to you!

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:22.940
No!

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:27.110
Kaiba boy, you must come.

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:33.210
If you don't, I'll sell all my Kaiba Corporation shares at once.

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:36.450
That'll cause your stock price to plummet.

00:19:37.220 --> 00:19:40.220
And your dreams will fail.

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:41.560
How dare you!

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:43.900
Come duel me, Kaiba boy.

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:45.310
Big brother...

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:48.990
I accept your challenge!

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:55.000
Then come to my villa in Duelist Kingdom.

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:58.170
I'll be waiting, Kaiba boy.

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:01.180
Big brother.

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:15.440
After Battle City, my brother sealed away his cards to focus on the Kaiba Land Project.

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:18.520
And now he's going to break the seal.

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:57.400
Other than Yugi, Pegasus is the only person I lost against.

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:12.350
If he's going to stand in my way again...

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:15.320
I'll crush him!

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:32.430
What's wrong?

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:36.700
Big brother...  Is Pegasus going to trap us again?

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:38.550
Don't be scared, Mokuba.

00:21:38.550 --> 00:21:41.140
I won't fall for take the same trick twice!

00:21:58.140 --> 00:22:07.050
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:15.390
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:26.550
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:27.170 --> 00:22:36.070
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:36.640 --> 00:22:45.100
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:45.880 --> 00:22:50.610
I'll live feeling them

00:22:51.220 --> 00:22:55.790
For me to be me

00:22:55.790 --> 00:23:04.250
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:04.930 --> 00:23:09.890
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:19.550
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:25.980 --> 00:23:29.580
Pegasus invites us to America.

00:23:29.580 --> 00:23:35.330
Meanwhile, Kaiba goes to Duelist Kingdom to confront Pegasus.

00:23:35.770 --> 00:23:38.910
Kaiba asks what's wrong with the Duel Monsters.

00:23:38.910 --> 00:23:42.760
Pegasus says it's all Kaiba Corporation's fault.

00:23:42.760 --> 00:23:46.240
But isn't Pegasus acting strangely?

00:23:46.670 --> 00:23:49.100
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Toon World's Nightmare

00:23:49.100 --> 00:23:50.680
Duel, standby!
